WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with arms by your sides, palms down.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
On an exhale, lift the legs overhead and support the lower back with the hands.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Continue until the toes reach the floor behind you, or rest them on a block or chair.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Walk the shoulder blades under, keep the neck still, and breathe quietly.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
To exit, roll down slowly vertebra by vertebra with bent knees if needed.
